WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.560
Pinky here! Three ratios,

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.340
and one silly word that holds them all:

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:08.200
SOH CAH TOA.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.050
Sine is opposite over hypotenuse.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.490
Cosine is adjacent over hypotenuse.

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.750
Tangent is opposite over adjacent.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:17.870
That's it. S O H,

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.640
C A H,

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.410
T O A.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.000
Here's a right triangle.

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:25.440
Legs three and four,

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.400
hypotenuse five. Start with the hypotenuse.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.060
It faces the right angle,

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.880
and it's always the longest side.

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:33.720
Now pick an angle.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.140
This one, right here.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.500
Stand on it,

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:37.280
and look across.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.920
The side you see,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.740
that's opposite: three.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:43.340
The leg touching you is adjacent:

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:44.780
four.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.920
So the sine of this angle is opposite over hypotenuse:

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.400
three fifths.

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:53.540
Your turn. Same triangle,

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:56.120
same angle. What's the tangent?

00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:57.680
Go.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:07.280
Three fourths! Opposite over adjacent.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.680
Now switch to the other angle.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.260
Watch the labels swap.

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:14.340
The four is now opposite.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:16.120
The three is adjacent.

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.560
The hypotenuse never moves.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:21.360
So always label from the angle they named.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.220
These ratios work directly on right triangles.

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:27.840
So find the right angle.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:29.620
Label from the named angle.

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.640
Then SOH CAH TOA.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:33.540
Now hit Try this skill!
